SUMMARY:2026 TSC World Conference
LOCATION:Gaylord Rockies Resort & Convention Center\, Aurora\, CO\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Held every four years by the TSC Alliance\, co-hosted with Tube
 rous Sclerosis Complex International (TSCi). ~1\,000 participants and ~45 
 sessions spanning research\, clinical care\, and family programming.\n\nWh
 y it matters for mTOR (★★★): TSC is the genetic disease that establi
 shed the TSC1/TSC2 -> Rheb -> mTORC1 axis\, and the only indication where 
 an mTOR inhibitor (everolimus) is approved on a directly genetic mTOR rati
 onale (EXIST-1/-2/-3). Anchors the human side of the Atlas's Clinic branch
 . Atlas authors carrying this evidence: Franz DN\, Krueger DA\, Bissler JJ
 \, Jozwiak S\, Kingswood JC\, Bebin EM\, Sparagana S\, Zonnenberg BA\, Bel
 ousova E. CAVEAT: mixed research/family conference\, not a pure scientific
  meeting\; the TSC Alliance also runs a research-only International TSC Re
 search Conference in off-years\, worth tracking separately.\n\nConference 
 site: https://www.tscalliance.org/event/2026-tsc-world-conference/\n\nIn O
 liver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-atlas.org/events/#ev-2026-tsc-world-confe
 rence
